    "enUS": {
      "description": "Any travel lodge worth its salt's gotta have somethin' to eat.\r\n\r\nSquid are in season, and ye can fish 'em up from the coasts here in Azshara. Never was much of an angler myself, but I'm a mean cook!\r\n\r\nWhat do ye say? Feelin' some seafood?\r\n\r\nIf ye aren't much for fishin', try makin' friends with one! Or pay 'em for their goods and buy some.",
      "dialogue": {
        "42260bdcd082a7e5d78a": "Perfect, these'll cook up nicely!",
        "bd583ce86e294966565d": "Got that squid yet? I'm gettin' a bit peckish now that I'm talkin' about it."
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Winter Squid",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Fish up 10 Winter Squid for Berdun Cliffbrew at Talrendis Point, in Azshara.",
